counterexample:
Passing the parameters explicitly between methods:
```rust
struct CleanReportGenerator {
    scratch_dir: String,
}

impl CleanReportGenerator {
    pub fn generate(&self) {
        let report_name = format!("report_{}.pdf", generate_id());
        self.compile_pdf(&report_name);
    }
    fn compile_pdf(&self, report_name: &str) {
        write_to(report_name);
    }
}
```
